 ### Optimized Triangle Representation
-A 3D triangle primitive defined by 3D vertices, sharpness parameter sigma, opacity, and spherical harmonic color coefficients. It is optimized by minimizing rendering error from posed views [S4]. The spherical harmonics degree is set to 3, resulting in 59 parameters per triangle, matching the parameter count of a single 3D Gaussian primitive in 3DGS [S4].
